{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, good to see you! What's new since we last met? Anything cool happening?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-2532a46355d276e4e24cfb19", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.094546+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2532a46355d276e4e24cfb19", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2532a46355d276e4e24cfb19", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam! Good to see you! Yeah, I just got back from a trip with my family in my new Prius."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-ad0d5393c1be99e96ed6f6e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.115417+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ad0d5393c1be99e96ed6f6e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ad0d5393c1be99e96ed6f6e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, not bad, what happened to the old one? Where'd you go, by the way?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-ec98fc911a705e41962e11b3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.129255+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec98fc911a705e41962e11b3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec98fc911a705e41962e11b3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: My old prius broke down, decided to get it repaired and sell it. Glad you asked, we went to Rockies, check it out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-bbddab5525a32520bcf16a15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.141094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bbddab5525a32520bcf16a15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bbddab5525a32520bcf16a15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow! Looks amazing. When did you get to go there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-017783228b3ffcacc897b8ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.157029+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "017783228b3ffcacc897b8ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "017783228b3ffcacc897b8ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: We all hiked the trails last week - the views were amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-0db6ee338bcc1a4968e52694", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.168409+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0db6ee338bcc1a4968e52694", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0db6ee338bcc1a4968e52694", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, that's cool. I love hiking, but it's been ages since I've done it. I did this hike with my dad way back when I was ten. Going hiking together was great fun, and really special for us."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-43298c43317fc98bcc8fe5a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.179529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "43298c43317fc98bcc8fe5a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "43298c43317fc98bcc8fe5a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Aww, that's cute. How far did you two hike?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-ef00fe0fe45dea9740d67ce6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.194720+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ef00fe0fe45dea9740d67ce6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ef00fe0fe45dea9740d67ce6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: We hiked a good distance - quite a feat for me back then. It's definitely a great memory."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-fc37d89ebd6c1c6411df0880", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.205964+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc37d89ebd6c1c6411df0880", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc37d89ebd6c1c6411df0880", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: What other hobbies have you found for yourself?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-7ae15412976bafce05760062", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.212644+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ae15412976bafce05760062", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ae15412976bafce05760062", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Nothing so far, but I was thinking about trying painting. Do you have any hobbies you love?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-5f707f5637e75176fa393270", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.226815+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5f707f5637e75176fa393270", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5f707f5637e75176fa393270", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Cool idea, Sam! I love it. Have you tried it before?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-dc8ec686b8d662a4adbae54e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.233820+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dc8ec686b8d662a4adbae54e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dc8ec686b8d662a4adbae54e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Not yet, but I'm keen to give it a go. It looks like a nice way to chill and get creative."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-50a4546debc8cf2b19e0851c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.247656+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50a4546debc8cf2b19e0851c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50a4546debc8cf2b19e0851c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yep, it's a great stress-buster. I started doing this a few years back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-af6a3cbb4ce34e25beeabde7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.261518+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af6a3cbb4ce34e25beeabde7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af6a3cbb4ce34e25beeabde7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, that's impressive! How did you get into watercolor painting?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-7d667d9ea5b09a5408d5cd51", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.272002+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d667d9ea5b09a5408d5cd51", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d667d9ea5b09a5408d5cd51", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: My friend got me into it and gave me some advice, and I was hooked right away!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-15ab3a5e36454e88e0eea93d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.282361+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "15ab3a5e36454e88e0eea93d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "15ab3a5e36454e88e0eea93d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow! I hope I can find something I'm as passionate about as you are with watercolor painting."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-88e1a78a1ec5c667f40a38cb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.293424+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "88e1a78a1ec5c667f40a38cb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "88e1a78a1ec5c667f40a38cb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: You'll find it, just keep trying new things until something sparks your excitement."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-b738789e463e8a7bebfabcbb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.303156+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b738789e463e8a7bebfabcbb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b738789e463e8a7bebfabcbb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! I'm excited to try new things, should be fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-33deaae09c8e9a99d7dadc17", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.313638+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33deaae09c8e9a99d7dadc17", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33deaae09c8e9a99d7dadc17", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, Sam! Super pumped for you! Let's catch up soon and see how you're enjoying your new hobbies!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-7c1d8c0f4b6f8ddf2c0de823", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.324013+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c1d8c0f4b6f8ddf2c0de823", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c1d8c0f4b6f8ddf2c0de823", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yeah, I'll keep you posted. See you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-235b555225b29ce7a7e559a9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.331028+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "235b555225b29ce7a7e559a9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "235b555225b29ce7a7e559a9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Take it easy, Evan! Can't wait to see you. Have a good one!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_1-a5721494a01fa6318bc2ae3a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:02.344829+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a5721494a01fa6318bc2ae3a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a5721494a01fa6318bc2ae3a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
